    "summary": "libero_spatial task 6 seed 2 solved in one episode (terminated:true at step 18). Localized everything perception-only: agentview_high.png chose the black bowl that is actually next to the cookies box (rejecting the akita bowl on the stove pedestal) and the striped plate; back_project region mode with z bands separated table (0.9004), plate (0.905\u20130.922) and bowl (0.926+), and SAM3 point segmentation gave robust per-object world_xyz. Pi0 was used only for the grasp ('pick up the black bowl'), then a closed gripper (+1) carried the bowl to the plate and I scripted the descent and release. First release missed the predicate (held-bowl lateral offset turned out to be ~(-0.009,+0.030), not the ~+0.064 assumed), and a low closed-gripper push could not slide the bowl up the plate's ~2 cm raised rim. A final retract with the fingers opening nudged the bowl into contact with the plate, which fired the On(bowl,plate) predicate and terminated the task. Audit and recipe written to the online-task output dir."
